   "descriptionHTML": "<p>2026.08.26</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>适配 Android 17 QPR2 Beta 3</li>\n<li>新增 <a href=\"https://github.com/LSPosed/ZygiskNext/blob/main/docs/hyos_runtime.md\">HyperOS Runtime 支持</a></li>\n<li>修复部分情况下 Zygisk 功能意外失效的问题</li>\n<li>修复 32 位 ARM 设备上的潜在异常</li>\n<li>调整 WebView 子进程 umount 方式，交由 Root 方案统一管理</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports Android 17 QPR2 Beta 3</li>\n<li>Adds <a href=\"https://github.com/LSPosed/ZygiskNext/blob/main/docs/hyos_runtime.md\">HyperOS Runtime support</a></li>\n<li>Fixed an issue where Zygisk functionality would unexpectedly fail in some cases</li>\n<li>Fixed potential anomalies on 32-bit ARM devices</li>\n<li>Adjusted the WebView child process umount mechanism, now managed by Root solution.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>SHA256: 474d58abc208c0779e7f8f1d8449db755a874d475c13b9cf8decf74bc171933b</p>",
